  "description": "Genomics.IO is the file-format foundation for the Genomics .NET ecosystem. Provides streaming, async, cancellable readers and writers for sequencing file formats (FASTA, FASTQ, VCF, SAM, and BAM shipped in the same package), gzip and BGZF handling, and format validation.",
